{
  "id": "world3-capital-sector-cla",
  "name": "World3-inspired capital with fixed allocation fractions",
  "description": "Isolated industrial/service capital teaching subsystem using the World3 output-ratio and depreciation laws. Industrial and service output divide capital by their capital/output ratios. Initial stocks use the cited implementation defaults; allocation fractions and resource allocation are frozen illustrative controls from the prior library scenario, not the full World3 endogenous equations. Capacity utilization is fixed at 1. No population, labor, resources, agriculture, pollution or output-allocation feedbacks are reconstructed, and no Limits to Growth or recalibration trajectory is claimed.",
